## Title: |cffff7f00Route|rXP - Leveling Guide
## Notes: Horde 30-60 leveling and questing guide for WoW: Forever. Speedrun routes, full zone guides, arrow and map route, auto accept/turn-in by quest ID, duo share, AH and gold farming. /routexp
